{"parse": {"title": "旧金山小子-08", "pageid": 60897, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A7%E9%87%91%E5%B1%B1%E5%B0%8F%E5%AD%90-07\" title=\"旧金山小子-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">旧金山小子-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">旧金山小子</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.BC.99.E8.AE.A1.E4.BB.AC\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"伙计们\">伙计们</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 伙计们</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Guys</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2060108</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_at_duanjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_at_duanjian\"><img alt=\"2_0_at_duanjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Cg-2_0_at_duanjian.png/600px-Cg-2_0_at_duanjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Cg-2_0_at_duanjian.png/900px-Cg-2_0_at_duanjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Cg-2_0_at_duanjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_at_duanjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>好小子，冷静点儿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我叫你冷静——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火星四溅。每一下捶打都像是一记鞭笞，为了驯服这些躁动不安的金属，匠人竭尽全力，健硕的肌肉在焰光中洒出一道道汗水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>铜和锡结合后，脾气暴躁易怒，就像它们易于折碎的脆弱，总是不愿同匠人好好合作，两种金属争吵不休，直到在火焰中合而为一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>锻造青铜虽然远不如对付钢铁那般费劲，但金属间那无休无止的对抗令他脑子里嗡嗡响个不停。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他不得不较往常更果决，看准时机，强迫这些拒不合作的金属在烈焰中结合。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而铁比前两者都更骄傲，也更顽固，J得花更多力气才能征服这一伟大的金属，J不得不花更多工夫“说服”这些又粗又硬的老家伙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他热汗淋淋，每一下锻打似乎也都敲在了自己的脊柱上，难以想象的疼痛和同样坚韧的忍耐为他赢得了金属的赞许与认可。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只有铝最轻快，轻快漂亮又调皮，又只有黄金优雅而沉默，从不与他作对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>冷静！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金属似乎在有意与之对抗，但“一锤定音”后，在J手中铁锤的教训下，一切变得安静了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一如既往，金属被他驯服，像一匹接纳了主人的烈马，一把新铸的剑即将诞生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>但愿你别像某些前辈那么嗜血，好剑只需要在必要的时候出鞘，伙计。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_duanjiancheku\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_duanjiancheku\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>J放下工具，猛猛灌下一壶凉水，喉咙口咕噜咕噜咕噜……擦去额头的热汗，伸手捡起一块金属徽章。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309413.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309413.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>嗯，很棒！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一份小小的礼物，准备送给那些即将重获自由的老朋友们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只要看到这个闪闪发亮的小玩意儿，人们就会知道这是海特街的J的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>J，有客人来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>买剑的老板吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>上一桩找他“买剑”的生意可不是好事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>客人先他一步走进工坊，警长先生笑着同昨晚的海特街英雄打招呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>早上好啊，J。你这儿……整得真热。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>炉火滚烫，匠人的作坊向来不是好受的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>想给手下的小子们整点新家伙吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>哈哈哈哈，暂时不用，但要是有生意，我一定先来你这儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>好了，闲话不多说。现在去我办公室，有些文件要你签字，J。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>订货？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>不，是人的事，你那些移民伙计们的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他履行承诺的时候到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>托你的福，上头松口了。人可以放走，但必须有人为他们担保，说实话都是些放狗屁的手续。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>就为了出事儿的时候黑锅不扣在自己脑袋上，说实话谁去签都一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我来，我为我的朋友负责。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>走，贝克特，去把霍利克也叫上，他要是在睡觉，你就把他踹起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>对了，把桌上那堆徽章也捎上。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_xingzhengdating\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_xingzhengdating\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>还有几张？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>每人一张，J。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>J不记得自己上一次写这么多字是什么时候，或许自打他出生，他就没像这样把自己的名字接连抄写过几十遍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>保利娜也许会乐于留下一个个漂亮的签名。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>J不由得想起了妹妹，那个喜欢做这些“体面”事儿的保利娜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>成了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>成了。别让他们在街上惹事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>在这等等。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>警长先生招呼几个伙计离开，留下一行三人等在大厅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我们上次来这是不是为了捞霍利克？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍利克：</div><div>是捞贝克特，J，他把人家的车轮胎扎了，还跑了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>我那是为了给你弄点私活！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍利克：</div><div>但钱都给老板赚了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>这事儿我怎么不知道，原来是你小子干的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>就那一回，J，你信我，就那一回……我就扎了一次。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍利克：</div><div>就那一次，还让车主逮着了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>什么逮着了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>警长先生大步走来，身后只跟着两个穿制服的年轻伙计。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>——呃，我们在说坏家伙终于让正义勇敢的警长大人逮着了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>我早看那群混蛋不爽了，多亏了J。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>J搞到了证据，上级可能拿这些东西做了交易，咱们也跟着沾到点剩饭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>你答应要放的人呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>我会放的。但那伙人一听说能出去，就闹个不停。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>我总不能在警察局里让你像牵羊一样牵着几十个吵吵嚷嚷的伙计出去吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>等局里的车回来，下午我把他们送到你店里去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>我做个好人，再替你给他们管一顿午饭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>那记得把这些东西发给他们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>闪亮的徽章，象征着乔·布朗的友谊和他的许诺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>你小子是想当地下警长了，哈哈哈哈哈，行，我会让戴着你徽章的人出现在你的餐馆里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">布莱克汉警长：</div><div>别忘了给他们准备一顿好的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>放心，我会重新给他们介绍工作，让大伙儿顿顿都能吃上好的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但在那之前，旧金山的小伙子们打算先去享受享受漂亮的晴天。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-chenei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"chenei\"><img alt=\"chenei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/600px-Cg-chenei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/900px-Cg-chenei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/1200px-Cg-chenei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>熄火了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>你不是说这车修好了吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625717.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-625717.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625717.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625717.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-625717.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625717.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-625717.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625717.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍利克：</div><div>这、这车来咱们厂报的时候只报了轮胎坏，我早给它修好了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>轮胎，发动机，车窗……处处见损。这车还剩下哪儿是好的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>好吧，下车，朋友们，车开到哪咱们就到哪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>拍照留念！纪念咱们的又一个胜利！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625719.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-625719.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625719.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625719.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-625719.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625719.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-625719.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625719.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特&amp;霍利克：</div><div>J的又一个胜利！海特街的又一个胜利！餐馆大伙儿的胜利！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>现在动起来！动起来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>熄火了就下车，这儿也不错，看看，伙计们，大桥就在咱们背后！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>大桥横跨金门海峡，数以万计的财富之梦曾从桥下驶过，一去不还。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0riverside.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0riverside\"><img alt=\"0riverside\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-0riverside.png/600px-Cg-0riverside.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-0riverside.png/900px-Cg-0riverside.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-0riverside.png/1200px-Cg-0riverside.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一行三人下车靠边，后备箱里的玩意儿们一件一件让小伙子们倒腾出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>相机、三脚架、啤酒、炸鸡、水果……忙完一笔大单子，总该好好犒劳犒劳自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-625710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-625710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-625710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍利克：</div><div>搭把手，J，我不太会捣鼓这玩意儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309413.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309413.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>把计时器插进快门口，你给它上一个弦，伙计，然后定十秒——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-625701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-625701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-625701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍利克：</div><div>扭，扭，再摁进去……好了！J！好了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>稚嫩的摄影师不太熟悉精密仪器，这跟他平日里接触的大铁块头差了太多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍利克：</div><div>来了，J——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>赶紧！伙计，跑过来，对，跑，跑起来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>十、九、八……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>七、六、五……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>霍利克——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309413.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309413.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>哈哈哈哈，当心点！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_at_jiujinshanxiaozi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_at_jiujinshanxiaozi\"><img alt=\"2_0_at_jiujinshanxiaozi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_at_jiujinshanxiaozi.png/600px-Cg-2_0_at_jiujinshanxiaozi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_at_jiujinshanxiaozi.png/900px-Cg-2_0_at_jiujinshanxiaozi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_at_jiujinshanxiaozi.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_at_jiujinshanxiaozi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>快门恰好捕捉到了胖伙计摔倒前那一刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>没事吧，伙计？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-625711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-625711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-625711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍利克：</div><div>*的，谁吃了香蕉把皮乱扔的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-625610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-625610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-625610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"135\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>对、对！谁乱扔的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>罪魁祸首装作毫不知情，默默把手指插进裤袋里摩挲，试图擦掉热带水果的气味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309413.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309413.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>贝克特，手拿出来瞅瞅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>刚吃了炸鸡，大哥，炸鸡，都是油，不好……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-625712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-625712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-625712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍利克：</div><div>贝！克！特！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>噢，慢点，慢点，霍利克，当心别又摔了——</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "旧金山小子-08"}}